        },
        "item_eMDDmD": {
          "type": "item",
          "settings": {
            "image": "shopify:\/\/shop_images\/20260401-142227.png",
            "text": "\"The Ulike Air 10 stands out to me for its sapphire ice cooling technology, which genuinely changes the comfort level during treatment. The SHR mode delivers high power in a controlled way, making sessions both efficient and consistent. Combined with its ergonomic design, it feels intuitive to use and well thought out for real world at home use.\"",
